OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1768918635
OL,3,CCity striker texts boss to say he
OL,4,Cwon't play in FA Cup tie over possible
OL,5,Cmove
OL,7,FNorwich head coach Philippe Clement
OL,8,Fhas claimed striker Josh Sargent
OL,9,Frefused to play in Sunday's 5-1 FA Cup
OL,10,Fvictory over Walsall ` but insisted
OL,11,Fthe United States international would
OL,12,Fnot be leaving Carrow Road during the
OL,13,FJanuary transfer window.
OL,15,FThe Canaries dominated their League
OL,16,FTwo opponents from start to finish in
OL,17,FSargent's absence, with fellow
OL,18,Ffrontman Jovon Makama leading the way
OL,19,Fwith a hat-trick to take his tally for
OL,20,Fthe season to 12.
