CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1768918635
OL,3,CCity striker texts boss to say he
OL,4,Cwon't play in FA Cup tie over possible
OL,5,Cmove
OL,7,F"Josh sent me a message (on Saturday)
OL,8,Fevening saying he would not be
OL,9,Favailable because of transfer things
OL,10,Fin his head," said Clement, with the
OL,11,Fplayer having been linked with a move
OL,12,Fto Major League Soccer's Toronto FC.
OL,14,F"This is obviously not something we
OL,15,Fwant, and will have consequences. It
OL,16,Fis something we need to speak about
OL,17,Finside the club, but the club has made
OL,18,Fit really clear to Josh and his agent
OL,19,Fthat he will not be leaving during
OL,20,Fthis transfer window."
