OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F316A1768918635
OL,3,CCity striker texts boss to say he
OL,4,Cwon't play in FA Cup tie over possible
OL,5,Cmove
OL,7,FOn Makama's display, Clement said: "I
OL,8,Fdon't want to praise him too much
OL,9,Fbecause he has to keep both feet on
OL,10,Fthe ground, which to be fair he is
OL,11,Fdoing at the moment.
OL,13,F"He has now scored more goals this
OL,14,Fseason than he did in League One all
OL,15,Flast season (for Lincoln) and he is
OL,16,Fimproving all the time ` but he has
OL,17,Fthe potential to be even better and
OL,18,Fmust keep working hard.
OL,26,@oD@dOUuD@AOU
