OL,3,CCity striker texts boss to say he
OL,4,Cwon't play in FA Cup tie over possible
OL,5,Cmove
OL,7,F"I was delighted with the performance
OL,8,Fof the whole team. It is not always
OL,9,Feasy against teams from lower leagues
OL,10,Fbut I thought the lads did really well
OL,11,Ftoday."
